@startuml identity-use-case-diagram
!include _style.puml
title playground-oauth - Use Case Diagram

left to right direction

actor "User" as User

rectangle "playground-oauth" {
  usecase "Register with\nEmail + Password\n(UC-01)" as UC1
  usecase "Log In with\nEmail + Password\n(UC-02)" as UC2
  usecase "Log In with\nOAuth Provider\n(UC-03)" as UC3
  usecase "Log Out\n(UC-04)" as UC4
}

User --> UC1
User --> UC2
User --> UC3
User --> UC4

note bottom of User
  One actor, reaching every use case through the web UI
  (REST). There is no MCP or other driving adapter in
  this project — see CLAUDE.md.
end note

' Grows as new-use-case scaffolds FR-05/FR-06 (Link/Unlink
' Social Identity) and FR-09/FR-10 (session expiry, list +
' revoke sessions).

@enduml
